# action-field — шаги записи (что показывается — action-field.md)
# Заказ 2026-10-07 после ревизии документации: Action Field — категории; next/previous оборачивают строку
# в коллаут и снимают обёртку; Cleanup убирает Values. Сценарий — таблица PENDING GIF action-field в docs/SHOWCASE.md.
title Action Field | Edits of the line, one key each
drop Due
drop Project
open Action field.md
line-width 480
room 400
caret - call the bank
stage New Action Field
say Add Field → Action: edits of the line
settings Tags & PKM
click Add Field
click Action
fill Field name = Edit
click Category to add to Field name
click Insert callout
click Add category
say Insert callout comes with Note, Tip and Warning
pause 1500
click Category to add to Edit
click Cleanup
click Add category
say A second category: Cleanup
pause 1500
click Add Field
pause 1200
close
stage next
caret - call the bank
say Edit · Insert callout next → the line goes into a callout
cmd edit-callouts-next
expect - book a table / > [!note] / > - call the bank
stage next again
say next again → Tip, then Warning
cmd edit-callouts-next
expect - book a table / > [!tip] / > - call the bank
cmd edit-callouts-next
expect - book a table / > [!warning] / > - call the bank
say One step past the last preset → the callout is gone
cmd edit-callouts-next
expect - book a table / - call the bank / - #todo #high || book the flight
stage Cleanup
caret - #todo #high || book the flight
say Edit · Cleanup next → the Values leave, your text stays
cmd edit-cleanup-next
expect - book a table / - call the bank / - book the flight
